pec at 6f2e8efc). The check's own red evidence is this gate receipt: it shows the old pattern returning 7 on a 30-row bank.","fingerprint":"none|docs/guides/api/check.test.mjs|stale-question-id-pattern","testable":true,"suggested_test":"Given docs/specs/api-guide.spec.md as at 6f2e8efc (DQ1-DQ16 and SQ1-SQ14 in §1, a diagram table D1-D7 in a later section, stated counts '30 questions' and 'Met at 30'), When `node --test docs/guides/api/check.test.mjs` runs A1/I8, Then the counted rows are 30, the diagram rows are not counted, and the test passes. With one stated count changed to anything but 30, the same test fails (docs/guides/api/check.test.mjs, test 'A1/I8')","untestable_reason":null}],"previous_attempts":["attempt 1: t1 builder write (6f2e8efc, spec rewrite as persona journeys); gate.write failed on A1/I8 because the stale ID pattern in the check counted 7 diagram rows, not the 30 questions; the spec's count was right, and no fix has been tried yet"]}
